    "pr_url": "https://github.com/prompt-toolkit/python-prompt-toolkit/pull/1827",
    "pr_body": "Enable autowrap before writing data to the output in `patch_stdout`. We enable/disable VT terminal processing during every `flush()` of the Windows Output implementation, but it turns out that this causes the autowrap flag to be reset each time. Because of this, we have to enable autowrap each time before writing.",
