  {
    "task_source": "pr",
    "pr_number": 1836,
    "pr_title": "fix memory leak for prompt_toolkit.filters.base.Never/Always and inline condition filter",
    "pr_url": "https://github.com/prompt-toolkit/python-prompt-toolkit/pull/1836",
    "pr_body": "Reference: https://github.com/prompt-toolkit/python-prompt-toolkit/issues/1835\r\n`Never/Always` is cached in `prompt_toolkit.filters.utils._bool_to_filter`, and if it is the first condition, it will hold the filter and cannot be freed.\r\n\r\nThe inline condition filter will have a different ID after the parent function is called (a new PromptSession is created). It will be cached by some global condition filter (e.g., is_searching), causing the cached size to increase and never be freed.",
    "pr_merge_commit": "465ab02854763fafc0099a2e38a56328c1cb0625",
    "loc_touched": 91,
